 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The reflective verbs",
   "texto": [
    "They work as in Spanish: **mi alzo** (I get up), **mi sveglio** (I wake up), **mi lavo** (I wash), **mi vesto** (I dress).",
    "The pronouns are **mi, ti, si, ci, vi, si**. Look at «We»: it's **ci**, not «No.».",
    "In denial, **non** goes before the pronoun: **Non mi alzo tardi**."
   ]
