   "texto": [
    "The meals have their own verb: **fare colazione** (breakfast), **pranzare** (lunch at noon), **cenare** (dinner).",
    "The parts of the day: **la mattina** (morning), **il pomeriggio** (afternoon), **la sera** (evening), **la notte** (evening). No preposition.",
    "**Ogni giorno** = every day. **Presto** = early, soon. **Tardi** = late."
